OL,3,AWho is Nvidia's interim CEO Colette
OL,4,AKress - and who could take over
OL,5,Apermanently?
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia is now facing a scenario few
OL,8,Fwould have considered until very
OL,9,Frecently - a future without Jensen
OL,10,FHuang.
OL,12,FThe influential co-founder of the AI
OL,13,Fchip-making giant resigned on Thursday
OL,14,Fover reports of extramarital affairs,
OL,15,Fone of which was with a woman suspected
OL,16,Fof being a Chinese spy.
